msgid ""
"Right away inventorying existing environments will provide you with "
"immediate insight to that environment.  Once an existing workload has "
"been discovered it can be converted to managed.  Once converted to "
"managed, Morpheus can deliver more capabilities and features."
msgstr ""
"Right away inventorying existing environments will provide you con "
"immediate insight to that environment. Once an existing workload ha sido "
"discovered it puede ser converted to managed. Once converted to managed, "
"Morpheus can deliver more capabilities y features."

